      "t": "When Senya's stash still isn't enough to feed all the guests, Mikhail Jekovich brings crates of gourmet food through his own hotel channels. Upstairs, Elena Pavlovna comforts a trembling Katya and gives her heartfelt advice before walking down the aisle.",
